{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Fisher - The Ultimate &quot;Slacking Off&quot; Fishing Experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual idle fishing game designed especially for office workers! During your busy workday, secretly open the game window, cast your line, and enjoy a moment of peace and the joy of catching fish. The game runs discreetly at the bottom of your desktop, letting you &quot;look like you're working, but actually be fishing&quot;\u2014the true digital art of slacking off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Real &quot;Desktop Fishing&quot; \u2013 The game runs in a minimalist window mode, can be hidden in the taskbar, Your boss will never know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Cyber Fish Ecosystem \u2013 Collect unique digital fish from the virtual ocean and become the ultimate cyber angler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Customizable Desktop Aquarium \u2013 Decorate your virtual fish tank with your catches and create your own cyber aquatic paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Perfect For:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Office workers &amp; students \u2013 Anyone who needs a secret escape during work or study</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Fishing game lovers \u2013 A stress-free, relaxing fishing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Pixel art &amp; idle game fans \u2013 Enjoy collecting and progression at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Start your &quot;paid fishing&quot; adventure today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Disclaimer: The game is fun, but don\u2019t get caught by your boss!~)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645300?t=1750673601","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645300?t=1750673601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps